WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.269
-Well, it was
another super-chill weekend

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.704
with the President
of the United States

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:07.073
retweeting a deranged
conspiracy theory

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.742
accusing a previous president
of murder.

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:12.912
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.616
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:19.786
Donald Trump has changed many
things in his life,

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:21.187
but there are a few constants.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.490
He's always been a racist,
he's always been a con artist,

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.825
and he's always been
a conspiracy theorist.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.960
Trump has paranoid fantasies
about everything

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.229
from climate change
to government surveillance

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:31.630
to the food he eats.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.066
According to the book
"Fire and Fury,"

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:35.301
he had a long-time fear
of being poisoned,

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.904
one reason why he liked to eat
at McDonald's.

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:42.174
Nobody knew he was coming,
and the food was safely premade.

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:44.043
Okay, first of all,
at this point,

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:46.579
I think they know you're coming.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.549
You are the norm of McDonald's.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.983
If you want to catch
a restaurant off guard,

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:53.753
walk into a Just Salad.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:57.123
Also really hammers home how
anti-science our president is

00:00:57.123 --> 00:01:00.826
that he eats fast food
to<i> avoid</i> being poisoned.

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:02.561
[ As Trump ]
"My body is a temple.

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:04.830
Two Filet-o-Fish, please."

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.700
[ Normal voice ]
During a 2016 town hall on CNN,

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.969
Trump basically admitted it
to Anderson Cooper.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:11.904
-I'm a person
that I like cleanliness,

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:14.607
I like clean, and the one thing
about the big franchises --

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.075
You have to have a certain --

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:17.376
You know,
because of the importance --

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:19.678
One bad hamburger,
you could destroy a McDonald's.

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:21.947
One bad hamburger,
you take Wendy's

00:01:21.947 --> 00:01:24.284
and all these other places,
and they're out of business.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.585
You can't do it.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:29.255
So, I'm a very clean person.
I like cleanliness.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.123
And I think you're better off
going there

00:01:31.123 --> 00:01:33.059
than maybe some place
that you have no idea

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.393
where the food's coming from.

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:37.463
-First of all, I would not call
you a very clean person.

00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:39.765
The only clean thing about you
is your desk,

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:41.901
and that's because
you don't do anything.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.502
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:45.438
Look at that.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.776
That looks like a Hollywood tour

00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:53.846
where they let you take a photo
on the set of "The West Wing."

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.281
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:57.349
There's not a single piece
of paper on that desk.

00:01:57.349 --> 00:01:59.385
When the next president
moves in, all they're gonna find

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.688
are the water rings left
by his Diet Cokes.

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:05.524
Also, you only think
McDonald's are clean

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:08.794
because you send other people
to pick up the food.

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:10.763
You based your opinion of
McDonald's on the commercials.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.298
[ As Trump ] "Here's the money.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.567
And remember -- Only take food
directly from the clown.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.669
He's the only one I trust."

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.037
[ Normal voice ]
Of course, Trump launched

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:19.706
his political career
by fabricating

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:22.341
a racist conspiracy theory about
President Obama's birthplace,

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:24.610
and it wasn't just that Trump
accused Obama

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:25.845
of being born in Kenya.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.513
He also invented
an insane fantasy

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:30.183
where Obama had faked documents,
and at one point,

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:32.051
he even claimed his own
investigators were

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:35.421
discovering evidence that proved
Obama was hiding the truth.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:37.156
-Three weeks ago,
when I started,

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:39.091
I thought he was probably born
in this country,

00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:41.828
and now I really have a much
bigger doubt than I did before.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.829
-He doesn't have
a birth certificate,

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:45.131
or he hasn't shown it.

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:47.433
He has what's called
a certificate of live birth.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.368
That is something
that's easy to get.

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:50.502
When you want
a birth certificate,

00:02:50.502 --> 00:02:51.737
it's very hard to get.

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:53.639
-But it's considered the
equivalent in the state --

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:55.141
-Excuse me.
It's not the equivalent.

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:56.242
-In the state of Hawaii,

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.344
they said they have seen
his document.

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.646
-I saw his.
I read it very carefully.

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:03.549
Doesn't have a serial number.
Doesn't have a signature.

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:05.217
There's not even a signature.

00:03:05.217 --> 00:03:07.319
-The biggest lie in that
interview was Trump saying

00:03:07.319 --> 00:03:09.054
Obama didn't have
a birth certificate.

00:03:09.054 --> 00:03:10.456
The second biggest lie
was Trump saying

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:12.691
he read something carefully.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.691 --> 00:03:14.927
I'd be shocked if he could make
it through something

00:03:14.927 --> 00:03:17.162
as long as a birth certificate.

00:03:17.162 --> 00:03:18.498
To help him fall asleep
at night,

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:20.332
he probably reads
a business card.

00:03:20.332 --> 00:03:24.002
[ As Trump ]
"Oh, they also have fax!"

00:03:24.002 --> 00:03:28.807
[ Normal voice ] Anyway,
continue with your bull[bleep].

00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:30.376
-I have people that have
actually been studying it,

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:32.010
and they cannot believe
what they're finding.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:35.848
-You have people now down there
searching in Hawaii?

00:03:35.848 --> 00:03:37.850
-Absolutely. And they cannot
believe what they're finding.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.553
-He said that eight years ago,
and he's never once explained

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:42.521
what they were finding,
and the reason is

00:03:42.521 --> 00:03:44.256
because there were
no investigators

00:03:44.256 --> 00:03:46.259
searching for documents
in Hawaii.

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:47.794
If he did send
anyone down there,

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:49.595
it was probably
his two weird sons.

00:03:49.595 --> 00:03:51.364
"You can't believe
what we're finding, Dad!

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.799
Their rocks have juice in them!"

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:54.900
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.203
"Did you tell him
about the juice rocks?!"

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:59.138
"I'm telling him right now!"

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:02.875
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:06.112
Trump even went so far
as to claim

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:08.080
that the contemporaneous
newspaper accounts

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.750
of Obama's birth
in local Hawaiian newspapers

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.051
had to have been faked.

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:14.954
-There were two announcements
the week he was born

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:19.759
in both Honolulu newspapers
saying that he was born, okay?

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:24.197
That is impossible
to make happen

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:26.699
if he had not been born
in the hospital.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:29.802
So, I just dismissed it, but
you made a big deal out of it.

00:04:29.802 --> 00:04:32.572
-Bill, I grew up
with Wall Street geniuses.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:36.409
What they do in terms of fraud
and how they change documents --

00:04:36.409 --> 00:04:37.776
And I'll tell you something.

00:04:37.776 --> 00:04:41.013
If you notice, those dates were
three days later,

00:04:41.013 --> 00:04:42.915
and here's what I ask people.

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:45.184
Who puts announcements?

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:49.088
Here are two poor people, a man
and a woman with no money.

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:52.124
They have a baby. There's
announcements in the newspaper?

00:04:52.124 --> 00:04:54.360
-The grandparents did it.
-The grandparents.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.629
Nelson Rockefeller doesn't put
announcements --

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.364
-Sure, there are birth
announcements all the time.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:04:59.866
-I've never seen one.
-Really?!

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:01.400
-No, I've never seen one.
-No, they're common.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.102
-I've never seen one.
-Maybe you've never seen one

00:05:03.102 --> 00:05:05.137
because your parents
never did one for you.

00:05:05.137 --> 00:05:07.640
If anything, they probably took
out an add that said,

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.943
"Donald Trump was born.
We're sorry."

00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:15.681
Then, of course, there's
the racist conspiracy theory

00:05:15.681 --> 00:05:17.616
that Trump has repeated since
he was elected

00:05:17.616 --> 00:05:19.418
that millions
of undocumented immigrants

00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:21.420
are voting illegally
in states like California.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.922
In fact, he just repeated
it last month in a speech

00:05:23.922 --> 00:05:25.425
to a group
of young conservatives,

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:27.427
and it barely registered
as a blip on the news

00:05:27.427 --> 00:05:29.328
because we're so numb to it now.

00:05:29.328 --> 00:05:30.796
-And then those illegals get out

00:05:30.796 --> 00:05:32.865
and vote
because they vote anyway.

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:34.500
Don't kid yourself.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.569
Those numbers in California
and numerous other states,

00:05:37.569 --> 00:05:39.104
they're rigged.

00:05:39.104 --> 00:05:41.474
You got people voting
that shouldn't be voting.

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:43.543
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:47.246 --> 00:05:49.949
They vote many times,
not just twice,

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:54.653
not just three times,
they vote -- it's like a circle.

00:05:54.653 --> 00:05:56.689
They come back,
they put a new hat on.

00:05:56.689 --> 00:05:58.491
They come back,
they put a new shirt on.

00:05:58.491 --> 00:06:01.360
And in many cases,
they don't even do that.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.761
You know what's going on.

00:06:02.761 --> 00:06:04.029
-I love the moment he's like,

00:06:04.029 --> 00:06:06.632
[as Trump] "Oh, [bleep]
what's the word for this?

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:09.768
Uh, I know there's a --
I'm gonna fall back on circle!"

00:06:09.768 --> 00:06:12.038
[ Normal voice ]
Trump has always been

00:06:12.038 --> 00:06:13.940
an unhinged conspiracy theorist,

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.242
and we saw that on display
yet again this weekend

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:18.744
when he retweeted
an insane conspiracy theory

00:06:18.744 --> 00:06:21.013
tying the Clintons to the death
of convicted pedophile

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:23.116
and accused sex trafficker
Jeffrey Epstein.

00:06:23.116 --> 00:06:24.516
-We begin this morning
with a retweet

00:06:24.516 --> 00:06:26.719
from the President
of the United States.

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:29.756
Not a message about healing
or uniting the country

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:31.924
one week after
two horrifying massacres,

00:06:31.924 --> 00:06:34.927
not about the victims
of those tragedies.

00:06:34.927 --> 00:06:38.030
Instead, President Trump, using
his massive Twitter platform,

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:43.402
63 million followers, to spread
a deranged conspiracy theory

00:06:43.402 --> 00:06:46.338
tying the death of pedophile
Jeffrey Epstein in prison

00:06:46.338 --> 00:06:49.842
to the President's former
political rivals, the Clintons.

00:06:49.842 --> 00:06:51.377
I'm not gonna show you
the tweet.

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:52.545
-Think about that.

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:54.313
The President's tweets are
so insane,

00:06:54.313 --> 00:06:56.715
the news can't even
show them now.

00:06:56.715 --> 00:06:58.784
It's getting to the point where
when he talks to reporters,

00:06:58.784 --> 00:07:02.187
they're gonna have to blur out
his entire face.

00:07:02.187 --> 00:07:04.723
They're gonna have to treat him
like accidental nudity.

00:07:04.723 --> 00:07:06.792
We elected President Nip Slip.

00:07:06.792 --> 00:07:08.627
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.627 --> 00:07:11.297
Trump's penchant for peddling
insane conspiracy theories

00:07:11.297 --> 00:07:13.366
isn't just
a weird personality quirk.

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:15.401
It has real consequences
for real people.

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:17.470
For example, he's repeatedly
given voice to the racist

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.071
and anti-Semitic
conspiracy theory

00:07:19.071 --> 00:07:21.907
that Democrats and the Jewish
philanthropist George Soros

00:07:21.907 --> 00:07:24.410
are somehow funding a plot
to have refugees invade

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:27.813
the United States by organizing
caravans of migrants.

00:07:27.813 --> 00:07:30.316
-The Democrats want caravans.

00:07:30.316 --> 00:07:31.717
They like the caravans.

00:07:31.717 --> 00:07:35.921
A lot of people say, "I wonder
who started that caravan."

00:07:35.921 --> 00:07:39.125
You know how
the caravan started?

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.727
Does everybody know
what this means?

00:07:41.727 --> 00:07:44.930
I think the Democrats had
something to do with it.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:47.099
-Do you think somebody's
funding the caravan?

00:07:47.099 --> 00:07:49.101
Do you think anyone's
paying for the caravan?

00:07:49.101 --> 00:07:50.936
-I wouldn't be surprised.
Yeah, I wouldn't be surprised.

00:07:50.936 --> 00:07:52.170
-George Soros?

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.972
-I don't know who,
but I wouldn't be surprised.

00:07:53.972 --> 00:07:55.274
A lot of people say yes.

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:57.409
-"I don't know who,
but a lot of people say yes."

00:07:57.409 --> 00:07:59.278
He always tries to do this move
where he pretends

00:07:59.278 --> 00:08:01.613
he doesn't know anything, but
a lot of people are saying it.

00:08:01.613 --> 00:08:03.148
I'm starting to think
these people

00:08:03.148 --> 00:08:04.750
are just other
Trump personalities.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.652
Golf Trump says
it's the Democrats,

00:08:06.652 --> 00:08:08.687
Sweaty Trump says it's Soros,

00:08:08.687 --> 00:08:12.224
and Empty Desk Trump says,
"Cheese!"

00:08:12.224 --> 00:08:15.293
Of course, Trump's not alone in
peddling this racist paranoia.

00:08:15.293 --> 00:08:17.830
The right-wing media outlets
he loves and echos

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.832
constantly repeat
deranged theories

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:21.200
about invading refugees,

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.302
the same language used
by white supremacists.

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:26.004
In fact, multiple Fox hosts have
defended the President's use

00:08:26.004 --> 00:08:28.173
of the word "invasion"
to describe desperate refugees

00:08:28.173 --> 00:08:30.609
seeking asylum, including
Fox host Jeanine Pirro,

00:08:30.609 --> 00:08:33.679
who used a very bizarre analogy
on her show Saturday night.

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:35.981
-Stop blaming the President
for this stuff.

00:08:35.981 --> 00:08:38.951
Even the guy said
before President Trump,

00:08:38.951 --> 00:08:40.685
"I didn't like the people
coming in,"

00:08:40.685 --> 00:08:42.421
so let's stop blaming Trump.
-He used that rhetoric.

00:08:42.421 --> 00:08:44.389
That's what makes it dangerous.
-Oh, come on.

00:08:44.389 --> 00:08:46.692
-Hey, we all use
the same language!

00:08:46.692 --> 00:08:48.560
We speak English!
So what?!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:51.497
-I don't call illegal immigrants
"invaders."

00:08:51.497 --> 00:08:53.599
-Yeah, well, a lot of people do.

00:08:53.599 --> 00:08:55.968
You know, I watch cartoons,
they have invaders, too,

00:08:55.968 --> 00:08:57.736
you know, from Mars.

00:08:57.736 --> 00:08:59.438
Stop with this craziness!

00:08:59.438 --> 00:09:02.408
-You can't say,
"Stop with the craziness"

00:09:02.408 --> 00:09:04.977
right after you say,
"I watch cartoons,

00:09:04.977 --> 00:09:07.013
and they have invaders
from Mars."

00:09:07.013 --> 00:09:09.715
[ Laughter ]
That is as jarring as hearing

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:13.852
a dog scream, "No pets allowed."

00:09:13.852 --> 00:09:15.788
-By the way,
the same weekend Trump retweeted

00:09:15.788 --> 00:09:18.023
his deranged Epstein theory,
he was in the Hamptons

00:09:18.023 --> 00:09:20.259
for a series of fundraisers
where tickets ran as high

00:09:20.259 --> 00:09:22.261
as $250,000, which sums up

00:09:22.261 --> 00:09:23.996
so much of our politics
right now --

00:09:23.996 --> 00:09:26.698
a paranoid president spreading
unhinged racist conspiracies

00:09:26.698 --> 00:09:29.468
while raking in millions from
a crowd of mega-rich supporters

00:09:29.468 --> 00:09:31.771
who don't care as long as
they can line their own pockets.

00:09:31.771 --> 00:09:33.505
Meanwhile, most sane people
are saying...

00:09:33.505 --> 00:09:35.474
-Stop with this craziness!

00:09:35.474 --> 00:09:37.576
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:09:37.576 --> 00:09:39.712
[ Cheers and applause ]

